SUMMARY:IMPROMPTU: Covered Bridge 54 mile Ride
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nThis is an opportunity to
  ride the Covered Bridge Classic 54 mile route. Average pace 12-13 mph. Fa
 ster riders are welcome and can form separate group as needed. Starting at
  Brownstown CTC.\nBring plenty of water and snacks. Planned stops at Shady
  Maple (open on Saturdays)\, Staufers will be open\, other locations as we
  identify prior to the ride.\n\n**54 Mile Route (Yellow Markings):** [http
 s://ridewithgps.com/routes/56327332](https://ridewithgps.com/routes/563273
 32)\n\n**Ride Leader: Jon Hartung**\n**Sweep: Volunteer**\n\n***Be Safe\, 
 Have Fun\, and Ride Together***\n\nHelmets are mandatory. No earbuds. Plea
 se bring water and a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2
  inflator) and money for ice cream.\n\nYour RSVP is your agreement to abid
 e by the club' [Code of Conduct](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content
 .aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984) and [Rules of the Road](
 https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&m
 odule_id=325159)\nGuidance if an incident occurs: [Incident Actions](https
 ://lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=
 326137)
